{"type":"plan","title":"Bánh Chưng Ngày Tết","logline":"Chiều Ba Mươi, bé An học gói bánh chưng cùng bà giữa sân nhà phố cổ; đêm giao thừa pháo hoa rực rỡ, sáng mùng Một chiếc bánh đầu tiên của An đặt trên bàn thờ.","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Golden dusk light fills the narrow courtyard of a Hanoi tube house. An and Bà sit on low stools around a wooden tray; fresh dong leaves, white glutinous rice, mung bean paste and pork belly are laid out. The inner courtyard walls rise three stories, tiled roof edges visible above.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Chiều Ba Mươi Tết, bé An cùng bà gói bánh chưng trong sân nhà ở phố cổ Hà Nội.","cites":[1,2,3,5]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Afternoon glow on Bà's hands as she spreads a dong leaf flat on the tray, scoops white glutinous rice, adds a layer of mung bean paste and a slice of pork belly. The wooden tray grain is clear.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Bà trải lá dong xanh lên mâm, đong gạo nếp trắng, nhân đậu xanh và thịt.","cites":[2,3,5]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Over An's shoulder: her small fingers fold the green leaf into a crisp square, then pull the bamboo string tight around the parcel, knotting it with careful tugs. The leaf creases stay sharp.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"An học bà gấp lá thật vuông và buộc lạt tre thật chặt.","cites":[2,4]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Two-shot from the side: An holds up her first finished cake, corners perfect. Bà leans in, eyes crinkling, pointing at the square edges. The tray and ingredients blur behind them.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Chiếc bánh đầu tiên An tự gói, bà khen vuông vắn như bánh của người lớn.","cites":[3,4]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Night has fallen; a low angle looks up at a large iron pot bubbling on a red-hot charcoal stove in the courtyard center. Steam rises in thick plumes, lit by the stove's ember glow. The tube-house walls frame the scene.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Đêm xuống, nồi bánh sôi lục bục trên bếp lửa hồng giữa sân.","cites":[1,5]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"From the opposite courtyard corner (180° rule): Bà and An sit cross-legged on a mat beside the simmering pot. Bà gestures with one hand, telling the tale of Lang Liêu offering square and round cakes to King Hùng. Firelight dances on their faces.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Hai bà cháu ngồi canh nồi bánh, bà kể chuyện Lang Liêu dâng bánh cho vua Hùng.","cites":[1,5]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Firelight close-up: Bà's finger taps the square cake on the tray — 'vuông như mặt đất'. An's eyes are round, lips slightly parted, fully absorbed. The cake's green leaf wrapper and bamboo string are crisp in focus.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Bà chỉ chiếc bánh vuông như mặt đất, An tròn mắt lắng nghe.","cites":[3]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"High angle over the old quarter: midnight sky erupts with fireworks — gold, red, green — blooming above rows of terracotta tiled roofs. The tube-house courtyards below are tiny dark wells. Light paints the ridges of each roof tile.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Đêm giao thừa, pháo hoa nở rực trên những mái ngói phố cổ.","cites":[6]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Dim ember glow only. An sleeps curled on Bà's lap, head on the folded ao dai. Her small fist still clutches a piece of bamboo string. Bà's hand rests gently on the child's shoulder.","mode":"still","dialogue":"An ngủ gục trên vai bà, tay vẫn nắm sợi lạt tre.","cites":[4]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Pale dawn light slips through the courtyard gate into the front room. An's eyes snap open; she scrambles up and darts through the low doorway into the living room, bare feet pattering on worn floorboards.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Sáng mùng Một, An mở mắt và chạy ra phòng khách.","cites":[1]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Insert shot on the family altar: a clean wooden surface, incense curls rising. Centered sits An's first square bánh chưng, leaves green, string neat, corners exact — the cake she wrapped with her own hands.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Trên bàn thờ là chiếc bánh chưng vuông vức đầu tiên do chính tay An gói.","cites":[3,5]}]}
